    {
      "_id": "HU3H5KyTMw1uv2dX",
      "_stats": {
        "coreVersion": "12.331",
        "compendiumSource": "Compendium.world.summoner-avatar.Item.whO4esN696cRSoGi"
      },
      "img": "systems/pf1/icons/feats/quick-draw.jpg",
      "name": "Link",
      "system": {
        "associations": {
          "classes": [
            "Avatar"
          ]
        },
        "class": "summonerAvatar",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>A summoner and his avatar share a mental link allows for communication across any distance (as long as they are on the same plane). This communication is a free action, allowing the summoner to give orders to his avatar at any time. In addition, magic items interfere with the summoner's connection to his avatar. As a result, the summoner and his avatar share magic item slots. For example, if the summoner is wearing a ring, his avatar can wear no more than one ring. In case of a conflict, the items worn by the summoner remain active, and those used by the avatar become dormant. The avatar must possess the appropriate appendages to utilize a magic item.</p>"
        },
        "subType": "classFeat",
        "abilityType": "ex",
        "contextNotes": [
          {
            "target": "skill.han",
            "text": "Free-action orders to avatar at any range (same plane); shared magic item slots (Not factored in)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "feat",
      "effects": [],
      "_key": "!actors.items!qfqbF0K2d3u6UnAS.HU3H5KyTMw1uv2dX"
    },
    {
      "_id": "Qhi0z7mvKLUnwUfW",
      "_stats": {
        "coreVersion": "12.331",
        "compendiumSource": "Compendium.world.summoner-avatar.Item.xc8uXIXh7uw17DJg"
      },
      "img": "systems/pf1/icons/skills/blue_11.jpg",
      "name": "MP Pool",
      "system": {
        "associations": {
          "classes": [
            "Avatar"
          ]
        },
        "class": "summonerAvatar",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>An avatar has an MP pool with a maximum equal to the summoner's level. The avatar regains MP equal to the summoner's level when the summoner does their 30-minute meditation after resting. The avatar may spend its magic points on spells and abilities granted by the specific avatar page. In the case of Yojimbo, this MP Pool is spent at a 1 MP to 10 gil ratio for his abilities but otherwise does not function as gil. Spells that would absorb MP treat avatars as they would summoned creatures, and do not work when allies use them.</p><p><em>Schema note: implemented as a pf1 Spell Points pool (<code>system.attributes.spells.spellbooks.spelllike.spellPoints</code>: <code>useSystem</code>, <code>value</code>, <code>maxFormula</code>, <code>restoreFormula</code>) on the avatar's actor sheet, with <code>maxFormula: \"@attributes.hd.total\"</code> since avatar HD equals summoner level.</em></p>"
        },
        "subType": "classFeat"
      },
      "type": "feat",
      "effects": [],
      "_key": "!actors.items!qfqbF0K2d3u6UnAS.Qhi0z7mvKLUnwUfW"
    },
